    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d124-a1">

                <pb facs="0219" n="99" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg99"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Foreign Affairs to Ambassador
                        Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-06-20"><hi rendition="#italic">June 20,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Ambassador</hi>: I have the honor to communicate
                    to your excellency, in addition to my note of the 14th instant, that, according
                    to the report of the port captain of the State of Bahia to the minister of
                    marine, the ensign similar to that of the United States of America which the
                    Brazilian schooner <hi rendition="#italic">Oliveira</hi> has been carrying has
                    already been retired.</p>
                <p>I improve, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio Branco.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
